From ed377b9343f01797c0716a219547b022d024a4f0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?=C3=98yvind=20Harboe?= <oyvind.harboe@zylin.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 22:04:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dpl: before the search, say when no search can legalize the
 placement
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The diamond search moves a cell only within its displacement window, and
rip-up-and-replace moves the cells it displaces within theirs, so
legalization is a matching of cells to free sites and Hall's condition
applies: it exists only if every set of cells has, in the union of their
windows, at least as many free sites as they need. Checking every set is
exponential; any one set that fails is proof. Tile the core into boxes
the size of the window, take the cells global placement left in each,
and compare the sites they need with the free sites in the box grown by
the window on every side. Demand over supply is a placement no search
order can legalize, reported in seconds with the worst windows in
microns, instead of the hours the search takes to prove it cell by cell.

The check runs before either engine, the legacy diamond search and the
default negotiation legalizer, whose windows extend up to the same
displacement cap; on take 19 of the same design the negotiation ran
past two hours where the check answers in a second.

Measured on a hierarchical asap7 design whose clock buffers landed in
channels narrower than they needed: 82 minutes of diamond search in the
CTS stage, 37 % of samples in one function, on a placement this check
rejects before the first move. For that flow the stop is the performance
improvement: no legalizer speed-up returns 82 minutes.

Passing proves nothing; some other set of cells may still fail. The
override is the option the search already has: a wider
-max_displacement, which the check re-runs against.

Signed-off-by: Øyvind Harboe <oyvind.harboe@zylin.com>
---
 src/dpl/include/dpl/Opendp.h |   1 +
 src/dpl/src/Opendp.cpp       |   4 ++
 src/dpl/src/Place.cpp        | 163 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 168 insertions(+)

